        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silent Bunker: Screaming Echoes is a first-person psychological horror and puzzle game set in a chilling, suspenseful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players play as John, who searches for his brother Robert, a paranormal investigator who vanished years ago. The abandoned bunker is filled with strange clues, cryptic notes, and unsettling events that hint at a dark mystery lurking within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is alive with flickering lights, echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and sudden jump scares that maintain constant tension. Every note, message, and discovery reveals fragments of the story, guiding players through the bunker’s haunting depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles test observation, logic, and patience, while the narrative gradually uncovers the fate of the missing brother. The combination of psychological tension, eerie environmental storytelling, and haunting audio-visual design creates a fully immersive horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silent Bunker: Screaming Echoes is a first-person psychological horror and puzzle game set in a chilling, suspenseful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players play as John, who searches for his brother Robert, a paranormal investigator who vanished years ago. The abandoned bunker is filled with strange clues, cryptic notes, and unsettling events that hint at a dark mystery lurking within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is alive with flickering lights, echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and sudden jump scares that maintain constant tension. Every note, message, and discovery reveals fragments of the story, guiding players through the bunker’s haunting depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles test observation, logic, and patience, while the narrative gradually uncovers the fate of the missing brother. The combination of psychological tension, eerie environmental storytelling, and haunting audio-visual design creates a fully immersive horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Search a dark bunker for a missing brother. Solve puzzles, uncover hidden clues, and survive terrifying encounters in a tense, immersive world.",
